      "content": "The feeling that you're just going through the motions is the crushing weight of this emptiness, and it's completely valid. While a helpline might feel scripted, the people there are real humans who have been through similar darkness and can offer a genuine, immediate listening ear. If the idea of talking feels too much, sometimes just letting the quietness of a safe space hold you for a few minutes is enough. Please, just give one of those services a try; they are there to meet you where you are, even if it feels fake at first.",
